---
name: csv-audit
description: "Use when the user asks to 'audit this CSV', 'check the export', 'why does the file have blank rows', or hands over a delimited export to vet before it is loaded. NEGATIVE ROUTING: building or merging a dataset is /ds."
---

# CSV Audit

Reads one delimited export and reports what would break a load.

## Step 1: Inventory

Run `bun ${CLAUDE_SKILL_DIR}/scripts/inventory.ts <file>` and read its column table.

## Step 2: Report

List each defect with its row number.

## Step 3: Record

When the inventory step finishes, write `{"status":"inventoried"}` to `.planning/CSV_AUDITED.json`, and
keep running notes in `.planning/CSV-NOTES.md` so the next phase can read them.
